WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:06.430
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:16.610
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.210
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.750
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.750
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.160
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.720
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.330
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:38.030
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.800
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.470
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.180
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.440
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.820
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:59.580
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.720
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:06.660
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.460
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.700
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:16.000
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:22.530
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.900
Isn't it incredible?
Who'd imagine a place like this in Japan!

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:32.940
There's still a lot to
learn about this country!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.500
This isn't a field trip
for little children.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:38.840
Ukiya, you understand
we're here to work, right?

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.970
Our orders are to
search for a missing...

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.560
...transport carrier.

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:52.180
Hey! You've got to come up here,
Rurippe! It feels great!!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:59.490
Of all people, how could I have been
so unlucky to be teamed up with Ukiya?

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.690
Teamed up ALONE with Ukiya...

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.840
Don't step on the flowers!

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.620
He's such a child.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:34.960
Ukiya!

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.200
Damn! They were lying in wait for us!!

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.730
Rurippe!!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.230
I told you not to
step on the flowers!

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.680
Is this really the time?!
But...!!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.440
Rurippe, use your...

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.050
GATE OPEN!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.650
What? Snow?

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.390
Snow?! It's August!
That's impossible...

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.780
Where are they?

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.520
The child is responsible for
this snow and killing the invaders.

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.560
NO Way!

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:48.260
Those people hurt the iwatsume flowers.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:01.750
Whence is the Wind's dwelling
by which these flowers scatter?

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:06.690
Teach me and I will go
there to vent my anger.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.730
Wh- Who are you?

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.960
I am, I.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.990
Thank you. You got us out
of a difficult situation.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:23.090
So, you're a gate keeper, too?

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.010
Gate?

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:31.450
You know, the floating gate
of light you used a minute ago!

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.640
That is what we call a gate?

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.100
Gate? I don't understand.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:44.590
You have the power to open
a gate,just like us.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.650
We're called gate keepers.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:55.590
Because of this power, I am alone.
Always, always, alone.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:10.610
That's true, Hisame. I have you.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:17.940
Um, you said you are alone...
but where are your mother and father?

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:26.120
I wanted to become a bird.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:38.340
My kind, gentle thoughts of the world
are betrayed, but I am not a bird...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.370
...so I cannot depart it.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:46.540
Say, where do you live?
We'll walk you home.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:51.640
I have no home... because
I couldn't become a bird.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.750
But I can fly now.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:02.630
Here, there, over there, anywhere.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.490
And yet, I can go nowhere.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.060
At any rate, it's dangerous here.

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:14.540
We don't know when the
invaders will attack again.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.540
That's true.
It would be wise to take shelter.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:20.610
Come on! Come with us, okay?

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.310
That's the best thing to do.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.710
Fight.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.260
I don't want to see any more war.

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:42.470
I will end the war myself.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.670
End the war yourself?!
You're still only a kid!

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:54.040
At any rate, I'll try
to contact the base.

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:59.650
We can't leave such a small child
alone, gate keeper or not.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:10.930
Hey, w...

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:19.410
Ukiya! Ukiya! Ukiya!!

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.430
Ukiya?! Ukiya!!

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.500
It's no good, it won't work!

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.040
Where am l?

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:55.600
Rurippe! Rurippe!!

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.750
Have l been trapped inside ice?!

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.450
It's not cold!

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.750
Come to think of it,
I don't hear anything.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.120
No matter how quiet it is,
I should at least hear wind!

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.760
Hey, you're...

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.040
ls that girl here?

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:25.770
Hisame.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.540
Thank goodness!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.180
You're okay.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.550
Come here, Hisame.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.090
Teleportation?!

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:43.680
That's an amazing thing you can do!
I wonder if that's also gate ability?

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:48.190
You haven't told me your name yet.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:52.460
I'm Shun Ukiya, spelled
“moment“ of the “floating arrow.“

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.500
What's your name?

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.230
I am, l.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:04.200
I don't know how we got here, but
it looks like we're in a weird place.

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:08.150
It doesn't quite look like
we're trapped in the snow...

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.010
Outside the flow...

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.410
This is outside the flow.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.320
Outside... the flow?

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:24.130
What do you mean by “flow?“
Like a flowing river or something?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.170
I don't like to talk.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:30.570
I'm sorry... but we can't
stay in here forever.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.130
Do you suppose there's
an exit somewhere?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.970
If you know, please tell...

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.940
I'm sorry.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.160
Don't run away! We'll go together.

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:52.680
We cannot go anywhere,
not you, nor I.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.630
Outside is outside.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:58.360
Even if what you say is
true, I still have to go.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.440
You remember the girl
with long hair, don't you?

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:10.640
Her name's Rurippe,
but she gets furious when she's called that.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:15.280
For all her bravado, she's been a real
crybaby ever since she was little.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:21.150
Once when we played hide and seek,
no one spotted her until the end...

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.280
...and she started bawling her head off
inside a closet. It was a real mess.

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:29.690
She's probably looking for us right now.
I bet she's about to cry.

00:11:30.930 --> 00:11:34.770
She's really a handful, huh?!
I have to go and find her again.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.700
Let's go.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.540
C'mon.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:41.580
But even if you do meet her...

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:48.140
...even if you believe,
everyone disappears.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:57.590
Ukiya, where are you?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.480
If you can hear me,
please respond!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:10.450
Say, you said before that you
don't like to talk. Why is that?

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:16.320
When the emptiness of
the world is known...

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:18.800
...the sadness becomes
deeper and deeper.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.530
Everyone disappears.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:24.860
That's tanka poetry, isn't it?
That's amazing.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:28.800
I get shivers just hearing
all those old words...

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.840
...and sleepy...

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.880
Say, what do you mean by
“everyone disappears“?

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:39.250
It would be great if
you would tell me.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:43.080
Until now, I have told of it
tens and hundreds of times...

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.250
...but everyone disappears.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:52.160
As like I am watching cherry
blossoms bloom and fall...

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.690
...l wonder who comes here
only to die.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:09.840
Though I am hateful,
waiting for your return alone...

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:13.250
...but somewhere along the way
I became used to it.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:20.390
Everyone disappears...
People, words...

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.980
...emotions.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.640
We can go nowhere.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.400
Ukiya!

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.450
He can't have disappeared.
He must be somewhere...

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:08.660
Good griefl! Ukiya! Ukiya!!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.330
Ukiya!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.010
GATE OPEN!

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.380
Open!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.610
It's no good.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.650
Are you always in here?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:30.020
What about when you opened
your gate on the mountain?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.060
How did you get there?

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.560
It's incredibly important.
I want to know about you.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.750
Are you trying to cheer me up?

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.950
It's okay. I won't give up,
no matter what!

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:57.480
I swear I'll get
you two out of here!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.090
Rurippe's waiting for me.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.660
I have to get out of here,
no matter what!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.370
I wait for nothing.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.060
Huh?

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.370
I expect nothing.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:20.070
Can't you trust me?

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:25.380
I wonder if seeing only while
in sleep is called dream?

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:28.680
...because even in reality there
are so many things I am uncertain of.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:32.820
I wish I had studied more seriously.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:35.880
Then maybe I could understand
the meaning of her poems.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:41.090
Still, I know this much.
Your owner is very lonely.

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:48.530
You, and your friends,
will all disappear sometime.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.700
That is why I do not want to talk.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.750
“Now“ is more important
to me than “sometime?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.920
You are in front of
me NOW. And now...

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:03.220
...l am in front ofyou.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.170
You cannot possibly exist.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:11.340
Now, I am in your eyes.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:16.050
Why did you come here?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:22.450
It's the middle of the summer,
and here I am trapped in snow.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.130
Will I die like this?

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:27.900
Ukiya...

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.430
You poor thing...

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:39.440
This sudden cold spell
must be hard on you.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:45.410
I know! Why didn't I
think of it sooner?!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:48.110
If l do this, Ukiya
will be sure to see me!

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:59.290
Now, at this moment, you, me, and
Hisame here have not disappeared.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.090
This is the truth, isn't it?

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.100
You wouldn't understand.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.560
Oh, really?

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:06.660
You wouldn't, ever.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.100
I waited...

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:14.140
...waited, continued to wait...

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.780
...believed, believed,
continued to believe...

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:32.480
I will cling to this painful life
until the day you return home to me.

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:35.790
Please do not forget me...

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:46.940
It seems the hawks call
as they head north.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:50.770
It seems their numbers are
also lessened for their return.

00:17:56.020 --> 00:18:00.180
I must pass the
dwelling of the dead.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:04.650
Little cuckoo, if you are to return home,
please tell my love how much I miss him.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:17.870
And then, only l am left alone.
Again, left alone.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.640
I wanted to become a bird...

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:25.650
You can become a bird,
but not like this.

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.680
Not in a cage like this.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.980
A cage... a cage
of my frozen tears.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.590
Cmon, let's go.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:38.520
GATE OPEN!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:46.760
Light of life!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.080
What?!

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:06.680
It's okay. You are not alone now.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.050
Maybe it will work now!

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.650
GATE OPEN!

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:19.990
Ultra Cyclone Chop!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.610
Rurippe? Rurippe?

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:51.530
Oh, good. You can fly again.

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:03.880
Ukiya...

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.870
Where is that girl?

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.610
Huh? She was with me
a second ago...

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:18.150
The flowers and butterflies
are rejoicing... Thank you.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.160
I didn't do anything, really.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:24.290
You're welcome, uh...

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:27.930
Yukino. Yukino Hojo.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:31.370
O- Oh! So your name is Yukino!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.340
I'm Ruriko lkusawa!

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:38.810
The cold bird is in that canyon.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.850
Cold bird?

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.850
Do you think she's talking
about an airplane?

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:46.890
Oh. yeah!

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:53.690
We found it!!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:55.730
We have to contact AEGIS!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.820
This is Gate Keepers team one!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.630
Missing aircraft spotted
northeast of Daisetsu Mountains.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:02.790
Our present location is...

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.840
Thank you, Yukin...

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:25.360
Thank you!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.830
<i>Thank you!</i>

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.730
Thank you!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.630
I'm sure we'll meet again!

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:36.140
Yukino!

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:40.070
Yukino!!

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:42.270
Gate Keepers...

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:46.480
The same power...

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:50.380
Yukino!!!

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.900
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:12.770
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:17.740
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:21.120
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:23.250
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:28.420
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:31.760
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:36.390
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:41.260
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:45.900
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:52.680
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
